Lock screen keyboard typing: the PIN bouncer accepts the digit printed on the Alt
layer of a letter key, so the PIN can be typed on the BlackBerry KEY2 keyboard.
A PIN digit typed while the screen is off also wakes the device and is delivered
to the keyguard instead of being swallowed.

